<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA- to Finnish Export Credit samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA- to Finnish Export Credit samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Tuesday that it had assigned its AA- rating to Finnish Export Credit Ltd's 15 billion yen of 5.25 percent yen/Australian dollar dual currency samurai bonds due on December 20, 1999.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that the outlook for the rating was positive.</p>
</text>
